FONTS IN THIS DIRECTORY

Third-party typefaces, redistributed here so the site can self-host them and
make no third-party requests.

Neither the repository's MIT licence (../../LICENSE) nor its content licence
(../../LICENSE-CONTENT) applies to these files. They are covered by their own
terms, set out below.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Satoshi-Variable.woff2   Satoshi Variable, version 2.000, wght 300-900
  Erode-Variable.woff2     Erode Variable, version 1.022, wght 300-700

  Copyright    Copyright 2017-2021 Indian Type Foundry. All rights reserved.
  Foundry      Indian Type Foundry - https://www.indiantypefoundry.com
  Designers    Satoshi - Deni Anggara
               Erode   - Nikhil Ranganathan, Jeremie Hornus
  Distributor  Fontshare - https://www.fontshare.com
  Full terms   https://fontshare.com/terms

  Trademarks   "Satoshi is a trademark of the Indian Type Foundry."
               "Erode is a trademark of the Indian Type Foundry."

  Licence notice, quoted verbatim from the name table of both font binaries
  (name ID 13), which is the foundry's own statement travelling with the file:

      This Font Software is protected under domestic and international
      trademark and copyright law. You agree to identify the ITF fonts by
      name and credit the ITF's ownership of the trademarks and copyrights
      in any design or production credits.

  That crediting requirement is met in README.md and on the /styleguide page,
  both of which name the typefaces and the foundry.

  SCOPE OF THIS FILE. The notice above is what the foundry embeds in the
  binaries. It is not the full ITF Free Font Licence, which lives at the URL
  above and in the Fontshare download bundle. If a verbatim in-repo copy is
  wanted, add it here from the Satoshi_Complete / Erode_Complete download —
  fontshare.com is not reachable from the agent sandbox that assembled this
  directory, so the full text could not be fetched and was deliberately not
  reconstructed from memory.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

  JetBrains Mono is the third face in the type system but is NOT in this
  directory. It comes from npm (@fontsource-variable/jetbrains-mono) and is
  imported in src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro, so the bundler emits it.

  Copyright    Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
               https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
  Licence      SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  Full text    node_modules/@fontsource-variable/jetbrains-mono/LICENSE
